[
  {"comment": "Printable bearings (mitcad#577), all as new bodies of the root. Bearing1 F1: a 608 (8 x 22 x 7) of dumbbells: walls 1.2 mm, the bands 0.4 mm from the elements, dumbbells 7 - 2 x 1.2 - 2 x 0.4 = 3.8 across on the 15 mm pitch circle with waists 0.95 deep, 10 of them; the races' ridges in the waists 0.4 mm along the axis from their flanks, so 0.4 / sqrt(2) = 0.282843 mm across. The inner race reaches 7.5 - (1.9 - 0.95 + 0.4) = 6.15 from the axis; element 1 lies on the x axis."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "printable_bearing", "size": "608", "plane": "xy", "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Bearing1", "status": "ok", "body": "F1.b0", "has_face": "F1:side(c4[c3,c5])"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F1.b0", "bbox": {"min": [-6.15, -6.15, 0], "max": [6.15, 6.15, 7]}, "tolerance": 1e-3}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F1.b1", "bbox": {"min": [-11, -11, 0], "max": [11, 11, 7]}, "tolerance": 1e-3}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F1.b2", "bbox": {"min": [5.6, -1.9, 0], "max": [9.4, 1.9, 7]}, "tolerance": 1e-3}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F1.b11", "has_face": "F1:inst9(F1:side(c201[c207,c202]))"}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "bearing_values", "uid": "F1"},
    "result": {"element_count": 10, "pitch_diameter": 15, "element_diameter": 3.8, "inner_wall": 1.2, "outer_wall": 1.2,
               "min_gap": 0.28284271247461906}, "tolerance": 1e-6}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "measure", "a": {"body": "F1.b0"}, "b": {"body": "F1.b2"}},
    "result": {"between": {"distance": 0.28284271247461906}}, "tolerance": 1e-5}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "measure", "a": {"body": "F1.b1"}, "b": {"body": "F1.b2"}},
    "result": {"between": {"distance": 0.28284271247461906}}, "tolerance": 1e-5}},
  {"comment": "Neighbouring dumbbells 36 degrees apart: 15 sin(18 deg) - 3.8 = 0.835255."},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "measure", "a": {"body": "F1.b2"}, "b": {"body": "F1.b3"}},
    "result": {"between": {"distance": 0.8352549156242114}}, "tolerance": 1e-5}},

  {"comment": "Bearing2 F2: a 6202 (15 x 35 x 11) of rollers at (50, 0): a 10 mm section, walls 10 / 6, rollers 5.866667 across with 1.466667 chamfers, 12 on the 25 mm pitch circle; the lips 0.4 along the axis from the chamfers, 0.282843 across, the bands 0.4."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "printable_bearing", "element": "roller", "size": "6202", "plane": "xy",
