  {"comment": "Bearing3 F3: printed balls of 9 mm in a 20 x 50 x 11 bearing at (0, 80): spheres with 45-degree caps cut by the faces (flat ends 2 x (4.5 sqrt(2) - 5.5) = 1.727922 across), 11 on the 35 mm pitch circle; the grooves' flats 0.4 from the equators, their flanks 0.4 along the axis from the caps."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "printable_bearing", "element": "ball", "bore": 20, "outside_diameter": 50,
