  {"comment": "Bearing4 F4: 6 mm airsoft balls (5.95 mm) in a 6202 at (100, 0): 8 balls (those that go into the crescent by hand), the cage's ring 11 - 5.5 - 3.375 = 2.125 thick above them, its pockets 0.4 mm round the balls."},
