  {"comment": "A ring 40 across with a 22 mm bore, 11 long, at (0, -60) (F6.b0; the bore F8:side(c1)). Bearing5 F9 cuts a 608's raceway into the bore (the ring the outer race, the middle 7 of its 11 mm): dumbbells such that the inner race keeps max(1.2, 7 / 4) = 1.75 mm, 11 - (r / 2 + 0.4) - (r + 0.4) - 4 = 1.75, r = 2.966667; the pitch radius 11 - (r / 2 + 0.4) = 9.116667, 8 dumbbells; the new inner race reaches 9.116667 - 1.883333 = 7.233333 from the axis."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_circle", "sketch": "F5", "center": [0, -60], "diameter": 40},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude", "profiles": [{"sketch": "F5", "region": "r{c1}"}],
    "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 11}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_circle", "sketch": "F7", "center": [0, -60], "diameter": 22},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude", "profiles": [{"sketch": "F7", "region": "r{c1}"}],
    "extent": {"type": "through_all"}, "operation": "cut", "participants": ["F6.b0"]}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "printable_bearing", "size": "608",
    "groove": {"body": "F6.b0", "face": "F8:side(c1)"}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Bearing5", "status": "ok", "body": "F9.b8"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F9.b0", "bbox": {"min": [-7.233333, -67.233333, 2], "max": [7.233333, -52.766667, 9]}, "tolerance": 1e-3}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "bearing_values", "uid": "F9"},
    "result": {"element_count": 8, "pitch_diameter": 18.233333333333334, "inner_wall": 1.75,
               "groove": {"diameter": 22, "race": "outer"}}, "tolerance": 1e-6}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "measure", "a": {"body": "F6.b0"}, "b": {"body": "F9.b1"}},
    "result": {"between": {"distance": 0.28284271247461906}}, "tolerance": 1e-5}},

  {"comment": "Every body a solid of its own, none touching another: 12 + 14 + 13 + 11 bodies of the bearings, the ring and Bearing5's inner race and 8 dumbbells."},
  {"expect": {"bodies": 60}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "interference"}, "result": {"bodies": 60, "pairs": []}}},

